<article class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 flex flex-col gap-12">
  <header data-animate-down class="text-center">
    <p class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-raw-sienna-700">
      Our story
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold uppercase text-zinc-950">
      About Us
    </h1>
  </header>

  <section data-animate-down class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-card">
    <div class="font-sans text-zinc-700 leading-7 space-y-4">
      <p>
        NextGear Motors is an independent car dealership in Dublin, Ireland. We specialize in the
        sale of quality used cars, 4x4s and vans, hand picking each vehicle for condition, history
        and value before it reaches the forecourt.
      </p>
      <p>
        Buying a used car should feel exciting, not stressful. That is why every car we list is
        inspected, honestly described and priced to reflect its true condition. What you read
        online is what you will find when you come to see it. Any inspection is welcome, and our
        team is happy to walk you through the service history, NCT status and anything else you
        want to know before you commit.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alongside direct sales we offer sourcing and trade-ins. If you are chasing a specific
        make, model or spec, tell us what you are after and we will use our trade contacts to
        track it down. If you already have a car, part exchange it against anything in stock.
        <.link class="text-raw-sienna-700 font-semibold hover:underline" patch={~p"/contact"}>Contact us</.link>
        for more information.
      </p>
      <p>
        From first browse to final handover, you deal with real people who care about putting you
        in the right car. Browse the stock or give us a call. We look
        forward to handing you the keys.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-animate-down class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-card">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-zinc-950 text-center">
      Privacy and Terms
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-4 font-sans text-zinc-700 leading-7 space-y-4">
      <p>
        Our privacy policy can be found <.link
          class="text-raw-sienna-700 font-semibold hover:underline"
          patch={~p"/privacy"}
        >here</.link>.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not share your data with third parties and only hold on to it just as long as needed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-animate-down class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-card">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-zinc-950 text-center">
      Website
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-4 font-sans text-zinc-700 leading-7 space-y-4">
      <p>
        This web app was created by
        <a
          class="text-raw-sienna-700 font-semibold hover:underline"
          href="https://github.com/baileyluTCD"
        >
          Luke Bailey
        </a>
        using <a
          class="text-raw-sienna-700 font-semibold hover:underline"
          href="https://www.phoenixframework.org/"
        >Phoenix</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Report any issues <a
          class="text-raw-sienna-700 font-semibold hover:underline"
          href="https://github.com/baileyluTCD/next-gear-motors/issues"
        >here</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        The source code is avalible
        <a
          class="text-raw-sienna-700 font-semibold hover:underline"
          href="https://github.com/baileyluTCD/next-gear-motors"
        >
          here
        </a>
        under a non-commercial license.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
